Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:07:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 19/28] config: ad blocking at the VPN's level (ad-block,
 ad-block-allow)

Four remote lists, each cached by itself; a name refused in DNS as a name that
doesn't exist, the route rule right after sniff and the DNS hijack; the user's
exceptions turn both into 'listed and not excepted'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
